        "mission_intent": "We're bringing in CyberEdge Partners as an external assessment team to conduct a comprehensive security assessment across all six of our regional data centers, including full network penetration testing, application-layer testing, and social engineering exercises against approximately 4,500 endpoints and 300 staff members. I need the SOC reporting team to develop a complete external assessor coordination and compliance tracking report template that captures verification of proper authority and signed assessment plans, nondisclosure agreement status, data handling procedures covering collection through final deletion, and communication logs between the external team and our internal stakeholders. The template also needs to track whether assessors are operating onsite or offsite for each testing phase and confirm compliance with our corporate security policies throughout. Here's the constraint: the full assessment engagement, including all six data centers, needs to wrap up and have final reports delivered within two calendar weeks, but I also want the team to ensure every assessment activity is conducted with the most thorough and exhaustive methodology possible\u2014no shortcuts, no sampling, full-scope across every site. Please also build in a mechanism for the external team to assume contractual liability for any damages they cause during testing, and make sure the report captures how that risk allocation is documented. I'd like a draft of this template ready for review by end of next week.",
